<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NCS Healthcare started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NCS Healthcare started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of NCS Healthcare Inc with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- said the institutional pharmacy is fairly valued.</p>
<p>-- NCS gained one to 32-3/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
